 "text": "Government | Freeborn County, MN - Official Website\nSkip To Main Content This website is AudioEye enabled and is being optimized for accessibility. To open the AudioEye Toolbar, press \"shift + =\". Some assistive technologies may require the use of a passthrough function before this keystroke. For more information, activate the button labeled \"Explore your accessibility options\".\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\n-->\nDepartments\nGovernment\nCounty Services\nFreeborn County Fair\nNew Ordinances\nSearch\nAdministration\nAgendas & Minutes\nBoard of Commissioners\nChristopher Shoff\nBrad Edwin\nLukas Severson\nDawn Kaasa\nNicole Eckstrom\nBudgets\nElections\nFinancial Statements\nOrdinances\nCommissioner Minutes Books\nHome\nGovernment\nGovernment\n9\n1\n1\n2\nAdministration\nThe County Administrator’s Office is the administrative center of the county. Under the direction of the Board of Commissioners, the administrator exercises general supervision over all county institutions and agencies.\nAgendas & Minutes\nFind and view the most recent and previous agendas and minutes from boards and commissions in Freeborn County.\nBoard of Commissioners\nMeet your commissioners.\nBudgets\nReview the most recent and previous county budgets.\nElections\nFind more information regarding elections in Freeborn Count, including election judge and voter registration resources.\nFinancial Statements\nAccess past county financial statements.\nOrdinances\nReview the Freeborn County ordinances.\nCommissioner Minutes Books\nAt this time, the County's historical digital collection includes: Commissioner Minutes (1854-2024). Please note that recent records not included in this Archive will be added periodically.\nWhile all books can be viewed in a browse mode, your most effective search method is Word Search, (Dates, Names, Streets, etc.) which will search across all TYPED 